libmpq
------------------------------------------
libmpq is a library which can be easily used in own applications to extract,
create or manipulate MoPaQ mpq archives.

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  liblzma5-5.8.4-1
  libmpq-devel-0.8.1-1bl1
  libmpq4-0.8.1-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  liblzma-devel-5.8.4-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/mbroemme/libmpq

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/mbroemme/libmpq/archive/refs/tags/v0.8.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libmpq-0.8.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libmpq-0.8.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libmpq-0.8.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmpq-0.8.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmpq4-0.8.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmpq-devel-0.8.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

